---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Colophon — YNS NUR"
  description="How this site is built, what is real on it, and what is still placeholder."
  field="bone"
>
  <section class="act colo" data-field="bone">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="colo__head">
        <h1 class="act-title">Colophon</h1>
        <p class="act__note">What this site is made of, and what on it is not real yet.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="colo__cols">
        <section>
          <h2 class="micro colo__sub">Type</h2>
          <dl class="colo__list">
            <div><dt>Display</dt><dd>Hitmarker Condensed Black</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Text</dt><dd>Suisse Int&rsquo;l</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Mono</dt><dd>F37 Zagma Mono</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="colo__note">
            All three are commercial faces. Web licences must be cleared before
            this site is published.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="micro colo__sub">Build</h2>
          <dl class="colo__list">
            <div><dt>Framework</dt><dd>Astro, static output</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Client JS</dt><dd>Players, loop scheduling, reveals</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Host</dt><dd>Not decided</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="micro colo__sub">The look</h2>
          <p class="colo__body">
            A title sequence, after Saul Bass: one flat saturated field per act,
            black cut-paper silhouettes, condensed caps, and credits that arrive
            in time. Sections are acts. The navigation is the credit roll. The
            CV is set as what a credit roll already is.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="micro colo__sub">What is real</h2>
          <ul class="colo__ul">
            <li>Orbit, the After Effects extension — real, unreleased.</li>
            <li>Six years of practice; the current position.</li>
            <li>The tools and handoff formats listed on the CV.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="micro colo__sub colo__sub--gap">What is placeholder</h2>
          <ul class="colo__ul">
            <li>Every moving image — 26 authored clips, none of them client work.</li>
            <li>Three of the four tools.</li>
            <li>Earlier positions and education on the CV.</li>
            <li>Every contact route, social link and live URL.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .colo__head {
    padding-bottom: var(--stack-s);
    border-bottom: var(--rule-heavy) solid currentColor;
    margin-bottom: var(--stack-l);
  }

  .colo__cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--stack-l);
  }

  @media (width >= 55rem) {
    .colo__cols {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--stack-xl) var(--stack-l);
    }
  }

  .colo__sub {
    padding-bottom: var(--stack-xs);
    border-bottom: var(--rule) solid currentColor;
    margin-bottom: var(--stack-s);
  }

  .colo__sub--gap {
    margin-top: var(--stack-l);
  }

  .colo__list {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .colo__list div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: var(--rule) solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--on-field) 18%, transparent);
  }

  .colo__list dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .colo__note,
  .colo__body {
    margin-top: var(--stack-s);
    color: var(--on-field-dim);
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .colo__ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--on-field-dim);
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
</style>
